# oracle: compute xrd on a periodic 3x3x3 fcc Ni crystal (108 atoms, pair_style none), manual reciprocal spacing c 0.1 0.1 0.1, LP 0 and 2Theta 0.7 1.3 in radians (the radian branch of the 2Theta range): fix ave/time writes c_XRD[1] and c_XRD[2] (format %.15g, mode vector) at run 0
# oracle: native: b332f28 (installed lmp; compute xrd is in the DIFFRACTION package of that binary)
# oracle-files: w134cp_xrd_ni_manual.txt
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=none filerel=1e-8
units           metal
boundary        p p p
lattice         fcc 3.52
region          box block 0 3 0 3 0 3
create_box      1 box
create_atoms    1 box
mass            * 58.71
pair_style      none
compute         XRD all xrd 1.541838 Ni 2Theta 0.7 1.3 c 0.1 0.1 0.1 LP 0 manual
fix             1 all ave/time 1 1 1 c_XRD[1] c_XRD[2] mode vector format " %.15g" file w134cp_xrd_ni_manual.txt
thermo_style    custom step pe
run             0
